Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.68,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You seem to be making good progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:06.15,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,I think you're at around 30% now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.47,0:00:08.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Does that mean I can use my powers again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.00,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:14.32,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,It means that you'll die if you use 30%\Nof what used to be your full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.59,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.50,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.91,0:00:25.42,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,This is Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:26.94,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,She's my friend, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:28.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:31.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,She was in the magic unit when we fought Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:32.34,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Oh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,She tripped all the time during training...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:38.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,and in the actual fight, I think she hurled \Na fireball in the wrong direction...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:39.81,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Hey! Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What do you call people like her, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.47,0:00:44.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:46.17,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,A klutz, that was it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.27,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:52.15,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,It's true that I'm clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.15,0:00:56.03,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um, it seems she has a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:57.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:59.17,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:00.36,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:01.66,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Can you please...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.55,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:07.10,Class - Top,Maria,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:11.08,Class - Top,Maria,0,0,0,,I meant that I want you to kill me\N when I lose control of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.75,0:01:16.97,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(398,302)}{\fad(568,936)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:12.92,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:16.97,sign_1721_32_The_Demon_King_s,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(536,302)}{\fad(568,936)}The Demon King's\N Daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:17.38,Class - Top,Maria,0,0,0,,Um, the truth is... I'm not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:17.89,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:19.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a night demon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:21.62,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:22.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, I had a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:27.12,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,There's something else\N that exists inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:30.19,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,A magical beast with fearsome powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:35.19,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Just once before, when I was \Nhaving a very hard time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.90,0:01:37.71,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.45,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:42.12,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,This is what happens when \NI can't control my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:44.13,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's okay, Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:45.43,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:48.08,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Until now, I was able to \Nsomehow keep it in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:52.04,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,But ever since then, I haven't \Nbeen able to fully hold it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You mean when we fought Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:57.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Touching fighting spirit, which flowed \Nthrough your magic energy conduits,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:01:59.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,made you lose control of your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:03.18,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You mean, unless we do something, that beast \Nis going to come out and wreak havoc?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:04.44,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.44,0:02:08.69,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,But I have nowhere else to go if \NI get kicked out of the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:12.36,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Maria was originally at \NRosewood Junior School, like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:16.86,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,She's worked hard for so \Nlong to enter this academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:19.89,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,My mother and father are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:21.82,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I don't have a home to go back to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:25.83,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,That's why I need to do \Nsomething about these powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:30.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know what it's like, \Nsince my parents are gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.20,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:32.29,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:33.92,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I never knew my mother or father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.30,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I'll help you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.20,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:37.34,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,And I as well, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.83,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'm friends with Maria now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:42.05,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,It's only natural to help out a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:43.88,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:45.89,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I want to help out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:49.77,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,A magic barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:55.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Whoa, how much power is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:58.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, I asked Claire and Yessica to adjust it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:00.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,so it should be cranked up to max power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:01.36,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.19,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You didn't ask for permission, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:05.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,All right, looks like we're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You've been holding back \Nyour powers this whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:11.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,so I thought you could try \Nreleasing them just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.23,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:13.00,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's why we prepared all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:17.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest is living proof that it can work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:19.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.01,0:03:20.79,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I can't ever do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:23.29,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I must not unleash these powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:26.31,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I need to keep them locked up\N for the rest of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:29.07,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:31.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why don't we try following \NBlade's suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:34.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It saved me once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.10,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} kind of a stupid method, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't call it stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What part of it isn't stupid, dummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:43.53,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Shut up, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:47.67,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:50.54,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I'll put my faith in Blade \Nand the rest of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:54.20,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I leave it to you if the worst comes to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.93,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah. We've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.93,0:03:57.21,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:04.59,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Each of these limits my power by half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:06.51,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:08.39,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Now it's four times the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:09.81,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,And another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.55,0:04:11.43,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Eight times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:13.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sixteen times?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:15.48,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,And finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:19.00,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,This is the most powerful sealing item,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.69,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,restricting my power to one-tenth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:23.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:24.99,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,One hundred and sixty times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:26.87,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait, Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:27.72,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:33.09,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.85,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,She's about to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.88,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I can't hold her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We'll take care of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:42.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Believe in your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:02.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:09.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The Demon King...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.90,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Bow before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:21.18,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Fear me! Worship me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:26.43,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Rejoice in the birth of the Demon King \Nwith cries of lament and rancor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.01,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's the Demon King?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:29.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:31.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But the satanic crest on her forehead...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.68,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Consume my flesh, Asmodeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:44.69,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:46.98,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:51.87,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.67,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:05.63,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power:\N Ultimate Gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:11.32,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't move after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:13.06,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I leave the rest to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.97,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Well, then, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:25.15,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,So hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:29.57,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.66,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You can have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.61,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Are you the last one left?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:45.36,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.80,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Once I'm out of here,\NI'll lay waste to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:55.22,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:58.53,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're trying \Nto take the Demon King alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.53,0:06:59.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Found me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.19,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You're a funny one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.04,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Fight me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:06.32,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Or I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.62,0:07:10.68,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I'm here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.99,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,If you don't intend to kill me,\NI'll make sure you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:16.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Don't give out on me, body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.95,0:07:18.91,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.54,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:28.71,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,If so, now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.92,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Don't die in one shot now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:32.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:33.09,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Sun Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:45.94,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Oh? You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:47.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:50.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest! Don't push yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:53.07,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Take this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:08:00.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Asmodeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.25,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,This goes very much against my will,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.08,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,but it is what my master desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.54,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I shall consider this a limited contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:09.31,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Oh? Now that's a fine weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:12.17,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It looks like I can expect \Na somewhat amusing fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:15.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't fight to amuse anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll be ending this with one blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.97,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You think you can take down \Nthe Demon King in one blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:22.04,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:23.02,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Show me, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.16,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,S-Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:34.86,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if even I can \Nfully handle such power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:36.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Quit your grumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:39.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're Earnest's sword,\Nso bear it with sheer willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:40.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Holy Demon Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:43.79,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.34,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.89,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Th-This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.66,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I'm being overpowered?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.79,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.93,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,What the hell {\i1}are{\i0} you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Just your ordinary fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:07.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,At least, I am now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:33.67,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm just glad no one ended up dying...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:35.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:46.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:53.19,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:54.86,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You big, fat idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.07,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so reckless anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:09:59.46,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Why do you always make me worry so much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:00.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:02.95,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You were dead, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:07.50,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,If I hadn't gotten to you in time, \Nyou would have been a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.49,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Last time, you promised you \Nwouldn't make me cry again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.46,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.77,0:10:15.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll be careful from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:19.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:20.96,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:23.01,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Claire is treating them as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:26.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And what about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.01,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:34.98,Class - Top,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.98,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:36.61,Class- Default,Girl Student A,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:37.44,Class- Default,Boy Student A,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:38.66,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:39.91,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,G-Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:42.87,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:44.87,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:46.30,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Good morning, Great Hero—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.21,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,So I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:53.04,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Now I have something to use against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Stop it, Maria. Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.32,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Maria is a different personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:10:59.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:02.29,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I don't... have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:05.51,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,No one's ever given me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:06.99,Class- Default,Girl Student D,0,0,0,,De-mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:08.72,Class- Default,Girl Student E,0,0,0,,Good morning, De-mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:09.60,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:12.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,De-mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.96,0:11:14.02,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.73,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I am the one who welcomed \NMaria into this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:20.22,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I'm aware of her identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:24.14,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Maria's mother was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:27.20,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, she's passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.33,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,And her father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.35,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,His fate is unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:33.29,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,However, we know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:38.80,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Her father was once known\Nas the Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:44.22,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,In other words, she's the \NDemon King's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.73,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,She really has gotten used to life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:56.03,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,But she's dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:57.77,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Is it okay to leave her alone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:11:59.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,His Majesty decided to let her go free,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:05.80,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,saying, "I'll take full responsibility!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:10.50,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Right now, with my powers curbed, \NI'm just an ordinary young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:13.33,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,If you tell me to attend school, I'll do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:16.54,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,and if you tell me to wear this \Nfrilly garb, I will oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:20.93,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You say that, but don't you really \Njust want to wear cute clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:21.91,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Stop that, Yessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:23.05,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Don't make her angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:24.56,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:27.51,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,If I'm honest, it {\i1}does{\i0} set my heart aflutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:30.52,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,This frilly garb is quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:37.43,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:39.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Let those girls go back to \Ntheir classrooms already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.40,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I didn't ask them to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:44.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you calling her Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:47.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Think of it like a nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:50.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Everyone calls her De-mao, \Nbut Mao is shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:51.24,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:54.06,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes. I am almighty, and generous as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:56.53,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I will allow this young girl to call me Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:58.76,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Dragons are the almighty ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:00.13,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,What'd you say, whelp?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.78,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Do you want a rematch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.12,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:07.58,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.89,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Break time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:11.76,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Great— I mean, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.77,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I'd happily welcome a \Nrematch with you any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:17.23,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Now then, let us be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:20.74,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.28,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Mao and Maria are distinct \Npersonalities, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:24.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:28.30,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Then how come Maria hasn't \Nshown herself ever since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:29.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.95,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:34.96,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Scared that I'll never be \Nable to see Maria again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.65,0:13:51.10,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Good morning, Great Hero Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.58,0:13:52.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:54.09,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:56.08,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I suppose I should say, "Good evening."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:58.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:14:01.05,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm here to invite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:03.30,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I heard about it from a fellow classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.32,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,She called it a da...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.57,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes, a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:07.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:08.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:11.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,A date begins at 1000 hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:14.78,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Look, Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:16.50,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,The moons are beautiful tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:19.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Seriously, stop calling me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:21.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Besides, the moons are always out at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:25.46,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Maria spent all her time \Nstaring at the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:30.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. How old are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:33.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You don't seem to know a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:37.68,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I began to gain self-awareness \Naround five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? You're five years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:42.15,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Age is no matter to a magical beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:46.72,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,As a lady, however, I don't appreciate \Nbeing treated as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:48.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're a lady now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:51.57,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Can't you see for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:57.81,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,And here I am, so attached to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:58.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:03.42,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,The reason I've stayed at this school \Nis because of you, Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:06.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You looked like you were enjoying \Nlife here at the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:09.04,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes, there's that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:11.15,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I do enjoy that frilly garb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:14.80,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,However, a magical beast \Nseeks out strength by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.80,0:15:16.85,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Everything else can be \Ndiscarded when it sees fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.12,0:15:21.96,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,And yet, I'm attached to you, \Nfor reasons I don't fully understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:26.86,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Even though you've grown weaker \Nsince our previous fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:30.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I was told that I'll die if I use\N 15% of my power next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:34.32,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,As you are, you're not a \Nfoe worth even killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:37.44,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,But I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:40.21,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I won't leave this place \Nuntil I've killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Man, that's brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.87,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It's not good to be unaware \Nof your own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:50.63,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I've thought about it,\Nand came up with a hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:53.09,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:58.01,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Perhaps I've become attracted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.09,0:16:01.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:02.99,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It's just a hypothesis,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:05.02,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,which is why I want to test it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.35,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Won't you be my mate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:15.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I don't really know what that'd involve...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.07,0:16:17.04,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.48,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You {\i1}do{\i0} realize I'm five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:20.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be easier to\N head over to a testing ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:24.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,and fight until we're both satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.44,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You're in no shape to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:32.25,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,What's more, I can't take \Nthis off of my own volition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:35.44,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Maria's consciousness\N within me resists it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.43,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,She's so weak, yet she defies me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:43.19,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,At the very least, I suppose she \N{\i1}did{\i0} bring me into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:45.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What happened to Maria?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:47.71,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Are Claire and the others worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.90,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,She's hiding away in the \Ndeepest recesses of the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:58.12,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Despite appearances, there are dark \Nshadows stewing within Maria's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:17:01.33,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,She was scorned and feared by humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.03,0:17:07.29,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,She rued her misfortune, forced to \Nlive in hiding with only our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:10.62,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Our mother believed in our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:14.26,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,However, Maria could not have faith in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:19.72,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Eventually, our mother died,\N and Maria's mind was flooded with doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.65,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Could it be that our father \Nhad not loved our mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:26.19,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Why had he abandoned the human realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:30.67,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Could it be that our father was \Nthe cause of all of her suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:37.56,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I was born in order to escape \Nthat unbearable pain in her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:39.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:43.25,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,So perhaps Maria might never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:45.02,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It would be easier that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:50.85,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I've told you all this because you're \Ncloser to our kind than to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.84,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,One more thing I like about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:56.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's all in the past now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:58.51,sign_25800_356_A_few_days_later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,268)}A few days later
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:03.72,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,From my research, I just can't see how \Nthat pendant could be a sealing item!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:04.91,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Um... who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.64,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,She's Maria's friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:08.98,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Eliza!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:11.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not a sealing item?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.83,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:17.62,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,If I'm wrong, I swear to disembowel myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You don't have to go that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.93,0:18:24.33,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,You say that, but I'm definitely \Nbeing restricted by this item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:26.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What kind of item is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.50,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:30.32,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to fully analyze it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:32.75,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,but I believe that it's some \Nsort of recording device.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:34.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:36.46,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,You could consider it a type of message cube.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:38.59,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,This is just conjecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:41.92,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,but it may contain a message from \Nthe person who gave you that pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:45.43,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Going by Maria's memories,\Nthis was a keepsake from our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:48.22,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Let me warn you beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.72,0:18:53.52,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I believe that recording could \Nserve to bring Maria back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.23,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,That would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:56.43,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:59.45,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It could end up destroying me,\Nthe Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:02.03,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,How fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.99,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Would we be okay if we play it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.92,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.04,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,In that case, let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:22.46,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Perhaps we could have become friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:24.93,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If it didn't mean losing Maria...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:26.39,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:29.77,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It seems that one of us \Nis destined to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:32.90,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I'm sure whoever remains will \Nbe friends with you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.28,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I'm ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.36,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Please open the pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:38.81,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:54.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.46,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,So this is the Demon King?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:20:00.17,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Huh, he's pretty hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:06.47,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,My beloved Emilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:07.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Emilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:09.20,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Our mother's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.20,0:20:13.08,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Find it in your heart to forgive \Nme for leaving you behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.08,0:20:15.00,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,No, resent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:18.07,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,There is a foe whom I must face in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:23.51,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,I do not wish to take you \Ndown this bloodied path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:25.79,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,You may think it self-serving of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.51,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,but there is a reason I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:31.62,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,You may not have realized it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:35.33,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,but your body houses a brand-new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:39.35,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,To think that I, a magical beast, \Ncould sire a child with a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:43.33,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Be it a boy or a girl, \NI've chosen names.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:45.34,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Ortous if it is male.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:47.63,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,If it is female, Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:52.62,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Once that child can understand language,\N tell them this:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.02,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Their father is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:03.90,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,How long are you going to hide in here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:07.45,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It's no fun beating someone \Nas useless as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.30,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:17.37,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Emilia. My child yet unseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:22.59,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,I swear upon my satanic crest that \NI will continue loving you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:29.84,Class - Italics,Demon King,0,0,0,,Forevermore, though my body may perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.36,0:21:33.20,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Mao, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:34.45,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:37.60,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I can barely control my body now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:41.99,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It seems that the strength of our wills\N plays a role in this battle, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:46.57,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,As we speak, the two of us are fighting \Nto see which one gets to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.39,0:21:54.50,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm about to \Nbe annihilated by Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:56.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.28,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:00.67,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Go on, call her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:06.34,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:10.35,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.04,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:44.22,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Don't you lose to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:45.71,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Maria! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:48.49,Class- Default,Student,0,0,0,,Maria! Show us the usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:50.38,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Um... do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:51.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:52.18,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.62,Class - Top,Mao,0,0,0,,Come, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.27,Class - Top,Mao,0,0,0,,Your life ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.24,0:23:02.19,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:11.49,Class - Top,Claire,0,0,0,,Mao didn't disappear, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.49,0:23:14.53,Class - Top,Eliza,0,0,0,,It must be because Maria \Nwants to coexist with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:17.50,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,This is the future she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.04,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:23.13,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,The Demon King would never...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:24.66,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:27.09,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Show Blade who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.30,0:23:40.02,sign_33910_447_Next_Time,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(568,1)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.02,sign_33928_448_The_General_and_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(568,1)}{\pos(435,231)}The General and the Sacred Bird
